TinyDecide engine

The runtime implementation at src/tinydecide/engine.ts is a maintained TypeScript
port of TheREZOR/TinyDecide at revision aa745b73a2db9a43bce731f0e8e5c90a6899fe2c.
It is not byte-exact upstream source. The byte-exact upstream JavaScript is retained
only as the test fixture test/fixtures/vendor/tinydecide-engine.js.txt; its SHA-256 is
577fb33b169b370711248b94bf4d9c6f61eda5f4f158710f177a96ffe74990d1. Tests verify
that checksum and compare tokenizer and weight-reader outputs against the fixture.
The fixture source is https://huggingface.co/TheREZOR/TinyDecide/resolve/aa745b73a2db9a43bce731f0e8e5c90a6899fe2c/tinydecide.js.
The test/tinydecide-engine-parity.mts verifier also loads the pinned model files and
compares all 219 decoded tensors and Choice, Score, Noul, and Span outputs between
the TypeScript runtime and the upstream fixture. The fixture is copied to a temporary
.mjs file for execution; the package runtime remains the TypeScript port.
The correction helper in src/tinydecide/corrections.js remains copied unchanged from
that revision; its SHA-256 is ee0de6af2b114b2c665c07c1e7908646c7afb939f69839184f72bf0436f990b9.
Its upstream source is https://huggingface.co/TheREZOR/TinyDecide/resolve/aa745b73a2db9a43bce731f0e8e5c90a6899fe2c/corrections.js.
The upstream model card declares Apache-2.0 for TinyDecide. See
https://huggingface.co/TheREZOR/TinyDecide/tree/aa745b73a2db9a43bce731f0e8e5c90a6899fe2c
for the source revision, model files, model card, and current license statement.

The pinned model files are downloaded separately and are not bundled in the
package. Their hashes and limits are recorded at
https://github.com/ykoh42/web-decision/blob/main/docs/model-support/TINYDECIDE_SUPPORT.md.
